## Role Permission Matrix

| Page | Admin | Manager | Staff | Cashier |
|---|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
| Dashboard | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ |
| Sale Terminal | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Products | ✅ | ✅ | 👁 view | ❌ |
| Purchases | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Inventory | ✅ | ✅ | 👁 view | ❌ |
| Adjustments | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |
| History Center | ✅ | ✅ | 👁 view | ❌ |
| Expenses | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Master Data | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Partners | ✅ | 👁 customers | ❌ | ❌ |
| Reports / BI | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Settings | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |

