## How to Test

1. Create a new Staff user with role = **Manager** or **Staff** (via Partners → Staff tab)
2. Log out, log back in as that user
3. The sidebar will only show pages that role is permitted to see
4. Pages accessed directly via URL will redirect to `/dashboard` or `/Sale` if not permitted
